<title>SWEDEN: Focus-Bank says Sweden should join EMU from 1999.</title>
<headline>Focus-Bank says Sweden should join EMU from 1999.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's powerful central bank ended months of fence-sitting on Friday to come down firmly on the side of Swedish membership of European Monetary Union (EMU), saying it should be among first joiners in January 1999.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said in a statement it rejected the conclusions of an official inquiry into Swedish EMU membership. saying the report had under-estimated the benefits to Sweden.</p>
<p>&quot;The economic benefits and the possiblity of influencing the future direction of monetary policy lead the Riksbank's governing board to conclude that Sweden should participate ...from the start,&quot; the bank said.</p>
</text>
